<title>USA: Cardiovascular Diagnostics OKs shr buyback.</title>
<headline>Cardiovascular Diagnostics OKs shr buyback.</headline>
<dateline>RALEIGH, N.C. 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cardiovascular Diagnostics Inc said on Friday it authorized the repurchase of up to 50,000 shares of its common stock from time to time in public or private transactions to pass on to its employees in connection with an employee stock purchase plan.</p>
<p>The company, which has 85 employees, develops, manufactures and markets systems designed to deliver blood test results.</p>
<p>The stock was unchanged at 4-1/2 in late morning trade.</p>
</text>
